# The retrocpu-tools release this repository observes: vm80a_sim (Verilator, FST
# output, internal registers) and the 8080 exercisers. Nothing is built here:
# scripts/retrocpu-fetch.sh downloads these assets by tag and refuses anything whose
# SHA-256 differs from the lines below (the release's SHA256SUMS).
RETROCPU_REPO=TheCBaH/devcontainer.retrocpu-tools
RETROCPU_TAG=v0.0.2

